@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 1. 회원가입 (Super Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트관리자",
  "email": "lucy@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "passwordConfirm": "password123",
  "organizationName": "테스트회사"
}

### 2. 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin5@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 토큰 갱신
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "refreshToken 넣기"
}

### 4. 로그아웃
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signout
Authorization: Bearer //accessToken 넣기

### --- 에러 케이스 ---

### 5. 중복 이메일 가입 (409 예상)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "중복유저",
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "passwordConfirm": "password123",
  "organizationName": "중복회사"
}

### 6. 비밀번호 불일치 (400 예상)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트",
  "email": "new@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "passwordConfirm": "wrongpassword",
  "organizationName": "테스트회사"
}

### 7. 잘못된 비밀번호 로그인 (401 예상)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 8. 쿠키 없이 로그아웃 (401 예상)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signout